NVzgiNCheVA"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["df['pos_ratio'] = df['positive'] / (df['positive'] + df['negative'])\n","\n","cols = ['price', 'positive', 'negative', 'owners', 'ccu', 'pos_ratio']\n","plt.figure(figsize=(6, 5))\n","sns.heatmap(df[cols].corr(method='spearman'), annot=True, cmap='coolwarm', center=0)\n","plt.title('Ma trận tương quan (Spearman)')\n","plt.tight_layout()\n","plt.show()\n","\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":507},"id":"ZDfLV72wjIZs","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1786593053113,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":338,"user":{"displayName":"gtdoanh","userId":"06429204965773275323"}},"outputId":"08e6f2de-25e3-41e0-b029-6f3d4401dc83"},"execution_count":24,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 600x500 with 2 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}}]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["plt.figure(figsize=(8, 5))\n","\n","sns.scatterplot(\n","    data=df.sample(min(5000, len(df)), random_state=42),\n","    x='price',\n","    y='pos_ratio',\n","    alpha=0.4\n",")\n","\n","plt.xlabel('Price ($)')\n","plt.ylabel('Positive Review Ratio')\n","plt.title('Mối quan hệ giữa Price và Positive Review Ratio')\n","plt.tight_layout()\n","plt.show()"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":507},"id":"RHQgbr7hF8D4","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1786593053417,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":302,"user":{"displayName":"gtdoanh","userId":"06429204965773275323"}},"outputId":"e182101b-ce4a-4299-b7c8-90af188d9545"},"execution_count":25,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 800x500 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Có phải game càng rẻ càng hay(nhiều pos) hoặc là nhiều người mua?"],"metadata":{"id":"jziSIeflj_dh"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["&emsp;Hệ số Spearman giữa price và pos_ratio khoảng 0.20, cho thấy mối quan hệ đơn điệu dương nhưng khá yếu. Trong phạm vi từ 0 đến 10 dô la, phân bố của pos reviews rộng. Vì vậy, trong dataset này, giá game không có mối quan hệ mạnh với tỷ lệ đánh giá tích cực.\n"],"metadata":{"id":"gBNTtF3JjpGM"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["df['total_reviews'] = df['positive'] + df['negative']\n","df['pos_pct'] = df['positive'] / df['total_reviews'].replace(0, pd.NA) * 100\n","\n","def classify(p):\n","    if pd.isna(p): return 'No Reviews'\n","    if p >= 95: return 'Overwhelmingly Positive'\n","    if p >= 80: return 'Very Positive'\n","    if p >= 70: return 'Positive / Mostly Positive'\n","    if p >= 40: return 'Mixed'\n","    if p >= 20: return 'Mostly Negative'\n","    return 'Negative / Overwhelmingly Negative'\n","\n","df['category'] = df['pos_pct'].apply(classify)\n","\n","order = ['Overwhelmingly Positive', 'Very Positive', 'Positive / Mostly Positive',\n","         'Mixed', 'Mostly Negative', 'Negative / Overwhelmingly Negative', 'No Reviews']\n","counts = df['category'].value_counts().reindex(order)\n","\n","plt.figure(figsize=(9, 5))\n","colors = ['#2e7d32', '#66bb6a', '#a5d6a7', '#ffee58', '#ff8a65', '#e53935', '#bdbdbd']\n","plt.bar(counts.index, counts.values, color=colors)\n","plt.xticks(rotation=45, ha='right')\n","plt.ylabel('Số lượng game')\n","plt.title('Phân loại game theo Steam Review Score')\n","plt.tight_layout()\n","plt.show()"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":507},"id":"CNnxAACpjpXu","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1786593053590,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":171,"user":{"displayName":"gtdoanh","userId":"06429204965773275323"}},"outputId":"6ee4045d-3d77-4af3-f914-6d200b0ba7f2"},"execution_count":26,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 900x500 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Các nhóm được xây dựng dựa trên positive review percentage để phục vụ mục đích phân tích, không phải nhãn Review Score chính thức của Steam:\n","- Overwhelmingly Positive: 9